# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository regardless of the host
# platform's `core.autocrlf` setting. Biome's formatter (lineEnding: lf) and
# the CI runners are configured for LF; the prior unspecified behavior let
# Windows checkouts commit CRLF, which then broke `npm run lint` on Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep platform-specific scripts in their native line endings.
*.bat   text eol=crlf
*.cmd   text eol=crlf
*.ps1   text eol=crlf

# Binary assets — never touch them.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.icns  binary
*.webp  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.zip   binary
*.gz    binary
*.7z    binary
*.exe   binary
*.dll   binary
*.dmg   binary
*.AppImage binary
